ambda=\\max\\Delta x_i","fallback":"λ=max Δxᵢ","block":false}]},{"item_key":"c5-2","tag":"高频","segments":[{"t":"text","v":"可积条件：连续必可积；有界且只有有限个第一类间断点也可积"}]},{"item_key":"c5-3","tag":"高频","segments":[{"t":"text","v":"性质：线性、区间可加、保号、估值："},{"t":"math","tex":"m(b-a)\\le\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx\\le M(b-a)","fallback":"m(b−a)≤∫_a^b f(x)dx≤M(b−a)","block":false}]},{"item_key":"c5-4","tag":"高频","segments":[{"t":"text","v":"积分中值定理："},{"t":"math","tex":"\\exists\\xi\\in[a,b],\\ \\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx=f(\\xi)(b-a)","fallback":"∃ξ∈[a,b]，∫_a^b f(x)dx = f(ξ)(b−a)","block":false}]}]},{"sub_title":"5.2 微积分基本定理","tag":"必考","items":[{"item_key":"c5-5","tag":"必考","segments":[{"t":"text","v":"变上限积分 "},{"t":"math","tex":"\\Phi(x)=\\int_a^x f(t)\\,dt","fallback":"Φ(x)=∫_a^x f(t)dt","block":false},{"t":"text","v":" 连续；若 f 连续，则 "},{"t":"math","tex":"\\Phi'(x)=f(x)","fallback":"Φ′(x)=f(x)","block":false}]},{"item_key":"c5-6","tag":"必考","segments":[{"t":"text","v":"推广："},{"t":"math","tex":"\\frac{d}{dx}\\int_{\\psi(x)}^{\\varphi(x)}f(t)\\,dt=f(\\varphi(x))\\varphi'(x)-f(\\psi(x))\\psi'(x)","fallback":"d/dx ∫_{ψ(x)}^{φ(x)} f(t)dt = f(φ)φ′ − f(ψ)ψ′","block":false}]},{"item_key":"c5-7","tag":"必考","segments":[{"t":"text","v":"牛顿−莱布尼茨公式："},{"t":"math","tex":"\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx=F(b)-F(a)","fallback":"∫_a^b f(x)dx = F(b)−F(a)","block":false}]}]},{"sub_title":"5.3 定积分换元与分部","tag":"必考","items":[{"item_key":"c5-8","tag":"必考","segments":[{"t":"text","v":"换元法："},{"t":"math","tex":"\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx=\\int_{\\alpha}^{\\beta}f(\\varphi(t))\\varphi'(t)\\,dt","fallback":"∫_a^b f(x)dx = ∫_α^β f(φ(t))φ′(t)dt","block":false},{"t":"text","v":"，必须同步换限，不需要回代"}]},{"item_key":"c5-9","tag":"必考","segments":[{"t":"text","v":"对称奇偶性：f 偶函数 ⇒ "},{"t":"math","tex":"\\int_{-a}^{a}f(x)\\,dx=2\\int_0^a f(x)\\,dx","fallback":"∫₋ₐᵃ f dx = 2∫₀ᵃ f dx","block":false},{"t":"text","v":"；f 奇函数 ⇒ "},{"t":"math","tex":"\\int_{-a}^{a}f(x)\\,dx=0","fallback":"∫₋ₐᵃ f dx = 0","block":false}]},{"item_key":"c5-10","tag":"必考","segments":[{"t":"text",